# Auth & roles rules

- Support login/register via:
  - Email/password
  - Google sign-in
- After signup/signin, ensure a `users/{uid}` document exists.
- On Google sign-in: if `users/{uid}` doesn't exist, create it with role "student" by default.
- Allow user to select only "student" or "teacher" at registration UI.
- Never allow setting "admin" from the client UI.
- Any role change must be restricted to admin-only operations (rules/backoffice).
- Keep auth state in a single `AuthProvider` + `useAuth()` hook.

